    "title": "Wednesday Night Forecast: Rain chances slim, colder air arrives Sunday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carson Vickroy ,\n5 hours ago\nTONIGHT: Mostly clear and mild. Low: 57. Winds: S 5-10 MPH.\nTOMORROW: Mostly sunny and warm. High: 81. Winds: S 10-15 MPH.\nFRIDAY: Partly cloudy and warm. Low: 62. High: 82. Winds: W 5 MPH.\nSATURDAY: Mostly sunny and warm. Low: 56. High: 83. Winds: W 5 MPH.\nSUNDAY: Mostly sunny, breezy, and much cooler. Low: 51. High: 63. Winds: N 15 MPH.\nMONDAY: Mostly sunny and chilly. Low: 35. High: 56. Winds: N 5-10 MPH.\nTUESDAY: Mostly sunny and chilly. Low: 34. High: 66. Winds: S 10-15 MPH.\nWEDNESDAY: Mostly sunny and warmer. Low: 50. High: 75. Winds: S 10-15 MPH.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KETK.com | FOX51.com.\n1",
